{"kind":"report","text":"Approve the complete site-interface DESIGN evidence at exact d16134f2bca279f233aed0ea21ac93139c9e3964, tree 9663340a25dbd970ce30b2562d3c785734844927, primary 5f8d39f8 first, for review 66c7 under checker promise e9fab8fb. This is evidence-only for original NoGit publication 23357877 and producer promise 49661f4b. It is not mergeable, closes no implementation, adopts no protocol and enables no current source. Normal owner judgment/adoption remains separate. No excluded ad634 task is revived.\n\nWhole-review coverage is complete. Root freshly read all 114,886 bytes/1,676 lines of BODY and all 9,847 bytes/147 lines of native U3 against 5e753ae3. Four independent readers freshly read disjoint sections covering the whole BODY and each complete U3; Root read all six sealed reports fully. No old/equal-body or locator-only shortcut. Ten FULL units total 279,007 bytes/4,087 LF in 45 bounded source displays; unique whole BODY/U3 total 124,733 bytes. Native hashes, contiguous offsets/LF/EOF and section composition pass with exit 0. BODY SHA256 babc98d9d161fb450d68c57150493e0f516172143dd73d9e412adc726e3185f7; U3 SHA256 42a28deb67712a21bbe0b6d3ed49e57d7802b8151f9f0144e008581231c52061. AGGREGATE.json SHA256 c897074b7040f01e824684cc9f26e2a712d66431e98c470d81e1724b98784ddb. Auxiliary interface context and normative reads remain separately qualified.\n\nThe construction repair is coherent across both complete read forms and answers. Full-slot factory reads bind actual service/full D, epoch/revision, purpose and role; renderer binding differs from controller/original-executor detailed recovery reads. Pre-slot locator discovery uses independently configured factory/service, actual renderer registration and key/tuple, locator, nonce and deadline. It needs no already-known D, full-D slot or known Room delegation in order to discover D. Possession of a key, EvidenceRef or URL supplies no authority. The shared factory-read/selection-read framing retains exact unsi